      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2017 WILEY-VCH Verlag GmbH & Co. KGaA, Weinheim.",
        "AbstractText": "A brand new, soluble quadruple-stranded copolymer is synthesized by using a self-template polymer from a new monomer. In addition, another very unique quadruple-stranded copolymer having a π-π stacking supramolecular polymer main chain is synthesized by selective photocyclic aromatization of the quadruple-stranded copolymer. The two quadruple-stranded copolymers gave self-standing membranes."
      },
